OL,3,GNEWSANo hospital admission
OL,4,A'contributed' to mum's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital's decision not to admit a
OL,7,Fyoung mother who died less than 24
OL,8,Fhours later from pneumonia "contributed
OL,9,Fto the death", an inquest found.
OL,11,FTanya McCartney, 25, died at her home
OL,12,Fin Derbyshire on 19 May 2023, after she
OL,13,Fwas sent home from Chesterfield Royal
OL,14,FHospital with a course of antibiotics.
OL,16,FHer mother Natasha Johnson said the
OL,17,Ffailures in her care, acknowledged by
OL,18,Fthe coroner, did not lessen "the
OL,19,Fabsolute heartbreak we live with every
OL,20,Fsingle day".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
