OL,3,GNEWSANo hospital admission
OL,4,A'contributed' to mum's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin Sargen, medical director at
OL,7,FChesterfield Royal Hospital NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust, said a thorough
OL,9,Freview had been carried out and
OL,10,Fimprovements made aimed at
OL,11,Fstrengthening patient assessment,
OL,12,Fescalation and clinical
OL,13,Fdecision-making.
